        <article data-uid="GameFramework.ConsoleTool">
  
  <h1 id="GameFramework_ConsoleTool" data-uid="GameFramework.ConsoleTool" class="text-break">Namespace GameFramework.ConsoleTool
  </h1>
  <div class="markdown level0 summary"></div>
  <div class="markdown level0 conceptual"></div>
  <div class="markdown level0 remarks"></div>

    <h3 id="classes">Classes
  </h3>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.html">Console</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Core console system that manages command execution, history, and output.</p>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="4" sourceendlinenumber="4">Architecture:</p>
<ul sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="8">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="5">Static class for global access (consider making non-static in future for better testability)</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="6" sourceendlinenumber="6">Manages command queue, history, and execution</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="7" sourceendlinenumber="7">Delegates UI operations to registered IConsoleUI implementation</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="8" sourceendlinenumber="8">Thread-safe command queuing for commands from other threads</li>
</ul>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="10" sourceendlinenumber="10">Command Execution Flow:</p>
<ol sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="14">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="11">Commands are queued via EnqueueCommand()</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="12" sourceendlinenumber="12">ConsoleUpdate() processes the queue each frame</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="13" sourceendlinenumber="13">Commands are tokenized and looked up in registry</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.Console.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="14" sourceendlinenumber="14">Command execution results are output to console</li>
</ol>
</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleContext.html">ConsoleContext</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Implementation of console context that provides safe access to console functionality
Acts as a facade to prevent commands from directly accessing console internals</p>
</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.html">ConsoleGUI</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="2">Console GUI component responsible for rendering console UI and handling user input.</p>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="4" sourceendlinenumber="4">Architecture:</p>
<ul sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="8">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="5">Pure UI component - only handles visual representation</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="6" sourceendlinenumber="6">Subscribes to console-specific input events (not toggle - that&apos;s handled by ConsoleService)</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="7" sourceendlinenumber="7">Uses events to communicate back to console system</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="8" sourceendlinenumber="8">Optimized string building for better performance</li>
</ul>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="10" sourceendlinenumber="10">Input Handling Flow:</p>
<ol sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="14">
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="11" sourceendlinenumber="11">InputManager detects console input (submit, tab, history) </li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="12" sourceendlinenumber="12">InputManager publishes console input events</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="13" sourceendlinenumber="13">ConsoleGUI receives events and updates UI accordingly</li>
<li sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.ConsoleGUI.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="14" sourceendlinenumber="14">ConsoleGUI calls Console static methods to execute commands</li>
</ol>
</dd>
    </dl>
    <h3 id="interfaces">Interfaces
  </h3>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.IConsoleCommand.html">IConsoleCommand</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.IConsoleCommand.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Interface for console commands that can be executed from the command line
Provides metadata and execution context for modular command system</p>
</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.IConsoleContext.html">IConsoleContext</a></dt>
      <dd><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.ConsoleTool.IConsoleContext.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Context interface providing access to console functionality
Allows commands to interact with the console system safely without direct access to internal state
Acts as a controlled facade that prevents commands from breaking console integrity</p>
</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl class="jumplist">
      <dt><a class="xref" href="GameFramework.ConsoleTool.IConsoleUI.html">IConsoleUI</a></dt>
      <dd></dd>
    </dl>
</article>

